	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotiveone.com           | |''');

		LocalFile.KoroneikiAccountAPI._createAccount(table = '''| Code                  | KORAUTO2                                 | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
