	| Region                | Japan                                    | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T1                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotivetwo.com           | |''');

		LocalFile.KoroneikiAccountAPI._viewAccountViaAccountFieldNameAndValue(
			fieldName = "Code",
			fieldValue = "KORAUTO1",
			table = '''| Code                  | KORAUTO1                                 | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account one on koroneiki | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Clone Automotive               | |
